(7724297, 1271882, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m so loving all the layers. So much to look at and then the empty chairs... wonderful. It feels like the entire city is empty.</td>', 'I''m so loving all the layers. So much to look at and then the empty chairs... wonderful. It feels like the entire city is empty.', '2022-07-29 01:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724298, 1271669, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like Miami....</td>', 'This looks like Miami....', '2022-07-29 01:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724299, 1271861, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a cool building. This could easily be haunting, but the lively green ceiling makes it hopeful. Escher-esq.</td>', 'What a cool building. This could easily be haunting, but the lively green ceiling makes it hopeful. Escher-esq.', '2022-07-29 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724300, 1271810, 96751, '<td valign="top">I really want to love this image, but something just doesn''t gel for me. I don''t know if it''s the arrangement of the pieces (which are all amazing), or the color scheme. I do really like the unusual lighting.</td>', 'I really want to love this image, but something just doesn''t gel for me. I don''t know if it''s the arrangement of the pieces (which are all amazing), or the color scheme. I do really like the unusual lighting.', '2022-07-29 02:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724320, 1271912, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh so cute!!</td>', 'Oh so cute!!', '2022-07-29 12:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724322, 1271724, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish we could know for sure that the container is empty.  It''s not clear and doesn''t really say "emptiness" to me.  Without the title, I think there''s a treat in there that he/she wants.  <br/> <br/>It''s a fabulous photo, though!</td>', 'I wish we could know for sure that the container is empty.  It''s not clear and doesn''t really say "emptiness" to me.  Without the title, I think there''s a treat in there that he/she wants.   It''s a fabulous photo, though!', '2022-07-29 12:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
