(7724376, 1271859, 122678, '<td valign="top">A beautiful Landscape. I love the autumn color palette in your image .</td>', 'A beautiful Landscape. I love the autumn color palette in your image .', '2022-07-30 08:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724377, 1271693, 122678, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. I feel like this is a very brave image in its coloration but yet all its lightness gives so much to this image. Your image leaves me with a true feeling of the very early morning. I also love the detail in the rocks and the sultry of the birds. A truly wonderful point of view here. Beautiful!</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. I feel like this is a very brave image in its coloration but yet all its lightness gives so much to this image. Your image leaves me with a true feeling of the very early morning. I also love the detail in the rocks and the sultry of the birds. A truly wonderful point of view here. Beautiful!', '2022-07-30 08:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724378, 1271724, 122678, '<td valign="top">Oh Boy, no more treats! Lovely dog image.</td>', 'Oh Boy, no more treats! Lovely dog image.', '2022-07-30 08:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724379, 1271921, 122678, '<td valign="top">This image really caught my eye. First the lighting, where is it coming from? The lighting looks to be artificial but its placement is so direct. Then you see what seems to be the last car leaving. Nice capture, I can assume this comes from a drone camera but the lighting leaves me perplexed I am not familiar with drone photography. Very, very nice image.</td>', 'This image really caught my eye. First the lighting, where is it coming from? The lighting looks to be artificial but its placement is so direct. Then you see what seems to be the last car leaving. Nice capture, I can assume this comes from a drone camera but the lighting leaves me perplexed I am not familiar with drone photography. Very, very nice image.', '2022-07-30 08:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724380, 1271810, 122678, '<td valign="top">Stunning coloration here with beautiful shaped glasses and their reflection. Lovely image.</td>', 'Stunning coloration here with beautiful shaped glasses and their reflection. Lovely image.', '2022-07-30 08:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724381, 1271907, 122678, '<td valign="top">Haha... nice empty image with a super title.</td>', 'Haha... nice empty image with a super title.', '2022-07-30 08:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724382, 1271787, 122678, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and image.</td>', 'Nice colors and image.', '2022-07-30 08:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724383, 1271912, 122678, '<td valign="top">Very cute play on this challenge. Adorable!</td>', 'Very cute play on this challenge. Adorable!', '2022-07-30 08:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724385, 1271859, 103142, '<td valign="top">Your photography has gotten very good, but this one falls short, imo. The biggest rule in landscape photograph is: don''t center your horizon. Have it fall at the 1/3 or 2/3s vertical.<br/> <br/>That being said, it''s a great rule to break with the right shot. This one, however, I don''t think does the halfway-horizon justice. I think you would have been much better off with the horizon at the top 1/3. The clouds are quite nice, but not nearly as interesting as the lower portion, so they''re given too much credit with this arrangement. -5-</td>', 'Your photography has gotten very good, but this one falls short, imo. The biggest rule in landscape photograph is: don''t center your horizon. Have it fall at the 1/3 or 2/3s vertical. That being said, it''s a great rule to break with the right shot. This one, however, I don''t think does the halfway-horizon justice. I think you would have been much better off with the horizon at the top 1/3. The clouds are quite nice, but not nearly as interesting as the lower portion, so they''re given too much credit with this arrangement. -5-', '2022-07-30 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724386, 1271905, 103142, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. I love the processing. The only thing of which I''m not sure is the tilt. It threw me off at first, then I thought "yeah -- that works", and then I changed my mind and didn''t like it again. But I think the whole reason is seeing that 1/5 of the left side of the photo. That draws my eyes, since it''s in the shadows, but still can be seen. I expect something wonderful in there, but then it''s empty (yes, I know, emptiness) and I feel dissatisfied. I think I would have absolutely adored it if the photo was cropped in from the left and that whole corner, indent was left out. Or, if there was more of that area--maybe about 1.5 times the size it is now -- so that you realized the whole place was empty - not just that one part with the stool.<br/> <br/>Is this an Anita? It reminds me of her toning. 7 for now. Probably moving to an 8. But I think it would have been a 9 with either of those thoughts.</td>', 'I love the idea. I love the processing. The only thing of which I''m not sure is the tilt. It threw me off at first, then I thought "yeah -- that works", and then I changed my mind and didn''t like it again. But I think the whole reason is seeing that 1/5 of the left side of the photo. That draws my eyes, since it''s in the shadows, but still can be seen. I expect something wonderful in there, but then it''s empty (yes, I know, emptiness) and I feel dissatisfied. I think I would have absolutely adored it if the photo was cropped in from the left and that whole corner, indent was left out. Or, if there was more of that area--maybe about 1.5 times the size it is now -- so that you realized the whole place was empty - not just that one part with the stool. Is this an Anita? It reminds me of her toning. 7 for now. Probably moving to an 8. But I think it would have been a 9 with either of those thoughts.', '2022-07-30 10:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724387, 1271901, 103142, '<td valign="top">This would have been so much more effective if there weren''t a lot of birds flying. If he was the only bird, and the rest was empty, it would have been awesone. Especially the razor wire emphasizing that the world needs to keep out. It''s an intriguing photo, but it just doesn''t meet the challenge, imo. -5-</td>', 'This would have been so much more effective if there weren''t a lot of birds flying. If he was the only bird, and the rest was empty, it would have been awesone. Especially the razor wire emphasizing that the world needs to keep out. It''s an intriguing photo, but it just doesn''t meet the challenge, imo. -5-', '2022-07-30 10:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
