(7724519, 1271921, 124815, '<td valign="top">I remember this parking lot from previous pictures and got quite attached to it. I like the glow, the hues, I love the general symmetry and the white lines of the design. Glad that on the iPad I can see the black scribbles like a forgotten hieroglyph</td>', 'I remember this parking lot from previous pictures and got quite attached to it. I like the glow, the hues, I love the general symmetry and the white lines of the design. Glad that on the iPad I can see the black scribbles like a forgotten hieroglyph', '2022-08-01 00:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7724520, 1271901, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice guardian. <br/>I am not partial to the title. To me the repeating in the title the word emptiness in a challenge named emptiness is somehow not trusting the viewer to make his/her own ideas about the image. Now I am forced to look at this beautiful image through your title and think that the little guardian does not really guard the emptiness but seems to rather enjoy the fluttering around it. <br/>Minor thing though and I ignore the title and, for now, give 7</td>', 'Nice guardian. I am not partial to the title. To me the repeating in the title the word emptiness in a challenge named emptiness is somehow not trusting the viewer to make his/her own ideas about the image. Now I am forced to look at this beautiful image through your title and think that the little guardian does not really guard the emptiness but seems to rather enjoy the fluttering around it. Minor thing though and I ignore the title and, for now, give 7', '2022-08-01 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
