(7724932, 1271905, 12611, '<td valign="top">Normally i would say that I like the pent-up energy of of the off kilter presented room. and although I dig the composition, it may not serve your purpose of emptiness to have the stool in the room, and the feel like it is going to slide out of frame., but the mood and the lighting and the concept make it better than many if not most in the challenge, imho, 7.</td>', 'Normally i would say that I like the pent-up energy of of the off kilter presented room. and although I dig the composition, it may not serve your purpose of emptiness to have the stool in the room, and the feel like it is going to slide out of frame., but the mood and the lighting and the concept make it better than many if not most in the challenge, imho, 7.', '2022-08-04 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
